  "description": {
   "en": "Songhwa, who had cut ties with her past and was living a quiet life as an ordinary office worker, one day decides to attend her high school reunion.\n\nHowever, when she arrives at the venue, she's unable to step inside—her appearance and life have changed too much from who she used to be.\n\nJust as she turns to leave, she unexpectedly reunites with Hyunwoo, a former classmate from high school...\n\nThough she feels uneasy as Hyunwoo stirs up memories she'd already buried,\nher heart also begins to flutter.\n\nIs what they have just friendship? Or could it be love?\n\nWould you like a title suggestion for this story?"
  },
